+# Reference flooding binding
+
+Explicit opt-in API: ReferenceBp(rows,n,probabilities), decode(syndrome,
+max_iterations,llr_max,history_window,fixed,diagnostics), build_identity(). See
+__init__.py and docs/reference_bp.md in the benchmark for shapes and statuses.
+
+Owned native vectors, no borrowed buffers, const/reentrant decoder, per-call cold
+starts, GIL released during native execution, no Python iteration callbacks.
+The last decision is valid only for CONVERGED. Both fixed values remove edges;
+LLRs/history contain only free_ids. Build from fork root with
+python setup_reference.py build_ext --inplace. Tests live in benchmark tests/.
